  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NOR-Development Support Program for Stone Quarry Affected Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to reduce the vulnerability of the communities predominantly Santhal, caused by the ruthless open cast mining and stone crushing in the bordering districts of Jharkhand and West Bengal.</narrative>
  </description>
